data: {"id": "111899003f6d4385-thinking-parallel_evidence-917", "run_id": "111899003f6d4385", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口：\n\n1. **Pod 状态当前为 Ready，但存在反复重启史**\n   - **证据（支持已恢复）**：kubectl_get_yaml 显示 `phase=Running` 且所有 Conditions（Ready, ContainersReady, PodScheduled, Initialized）均为 `status=True`。\n   - **证据（异常历史）**：`containerStatuses.app` 显示 `restarts=3` 且最后一次退出的 `exitCode=137`（OOMKilled 标准码）。\n\n2. **Probe 事件揭示当前处于“刚恢复”或“间歇性故障”期**\n   - **证据（支持恢复中/间歇）**：kubectl_events 显示最近 10s 内存在 `Liveness probe failed (context deadline exceeded)` 和 `Readiness probe failed (connection refused)`，且伴随 `Killing` 事件。这与 Pod 当前 `Rea", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789391274158, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

